OL,3,GNEWSAMan given unpaid work after drugs
OL,4,Afound in child's pocket at nursery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been ordered to carry out 160
OL,7,Fhours of unpaid work after a toddler
OL,8,Fwas found with two packets of drugs in
OL,9,Fher pockets at nursery.
OL,11,FGeorge Robertson's home was raided by
OL,12,Fpolice after staff at the nursery in
OL,13,FGlasgow's Southside found diazepam and
OL,14,Fcocaine in the two-year-old's jacket in
OL,15,FMay last year.
OL,17,FGlasgow Sheriff Court heard that a
OL,18,Fsix-month-old baby in his care was also
OL,19,Ffound to have nappy rash, scabs and dry
OL,20,Fskin on her body and "friction burn" in
OL,21,FApril 2025.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
