OL,3,GNEWSAMan given unpaid work after drugs
OL,4,Afound in child's pocket at nursery
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobertson, 37, of Paisley,
OL,7,FRenfrewshire, was also placed under a
OL,8,F12-month supervision order after
OL,9,Fadmitting two charges of wilfully
OL,10,Fexposing the children in a manner to
OL,11,Fcause them unnecessary suffering or
OL,12,Finjury to health.
